{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Pierre a un entretien d'embauche", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Une personnalit\u00e9 gagnante !", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant \u00e9change de l'information sur des consignes concernant des activit\u00e9s simples et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 sur le lieu de travail", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "  Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "La personnalit\u00e9 des gens", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez des adjectifs pour d\u00e9crire la personnalit\u00e9 des gens et parler de leurs r\u00e9actions et comportements habituels. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Les adjectifs peuvent \u00eatre plac\u00e9s apr\u00e8s le  verbe <span class=\"strong\">\u00eatre</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Vous pouvez utiliser la structure suivante :", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sujet + \u00eatre + adjectif <br /><span class=\"italic\">Il/Elle  + est + motiv\u00e9(e).</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Mot qui d\u00e9crit la personnalit\u00e9</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fain\u00e9ant(e) <br />responsable <br />dr\u00f4le<br />gentil(le) <br />\u00e9nergique <br />timide <br />extraverti(e)<br /> dr\u00f4le<br /> intelligent(e)<br /> aimable<br /> responsable<br /> assidu(e)<br /> sympa(thique)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez pour d\u00e9crire la personnalit\u00e9 des gens.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "travailler dur", "type": "name"}, {"content": "faire beaucoup d'effort", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Nous recherchons un individu qui travaille dur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "responsable ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "capable de faire confiance et de faire les choses de fa\u00e7on ind\u00e9pendante", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Vous \u00eates responsable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gagnant, gagnante", "type": "name"}, {"content": " vainqueur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je veux un individu avec une personalit\u00e9 gagnante.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "la d\u00e9cision ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un choix que vous faites quand vous avez beaucoup r\u00e9fl\u00e9chi", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Quand nous prendrons une d\u00e9cision, nous allons vous appeler.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cordial, cordiale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "poli, polie", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Vous \u00eates cordiale. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fain\u00e9ant, fain\u00e9ante", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une personne qui ne travaille pas beaucoup", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Je ne veux pas une personne fain\u00e9ante. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Trouvez 4 diff\u00e9rents emplois qu'occupent les gens.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Faites une liste des qualit\u00e9s qui vous paraissent essentielles pour occuper ces emplois. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 4 phrases pour d\u00e9crire la personnalit\u00e9 des personnes.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris des phrases compl\u00e8tes sur les emplois.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je d\u00e9cris la personnalit\u00e9 des gens.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le08ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le08ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "10", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span> :      Bonjour Pierre. Je suis M. Lafarge. Enchant\u00e9 de vous rencontrer.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      Euh... Bonjour M. Lafarge. Enchant\u00e9 \u00e9galement. Je suis d\u00e9sol\u00e9 mais je suis un peu nerveux.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span> :     Asseyez-vous, s'il vous pla\u00eet ? Est-ce que vous voulez un verre d'eau ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      Non, merci."}, {"image": "frn2le08ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "18000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span> :      Tr\u00e8s bien. Parlez-moi de vous. \u00cates-vous \u00e9tudiant ?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :    Oui, je suis \u00e9tudiant en commerce \u00e0 l'universit\u00e9 de Censier. Je fais du volontariat \u00e0 la biblioth\u00e8que&nbsp;!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span> :      Excellent. Nous recherchons une personne cordiale."}, {"image": "frn2le08ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Humm.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span> :     Nous recherchons aussi une personne responsable qui travaille dur avec une v\u00e9ritable personnalit\u00e9 gagnante ! Nous ne souhaitons pas une personne qui ne soit pas motiv\u00e9e.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> :      M. Lafarge, je suis convaincu que je suis la bonne personne pour ce r\u00f4le.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">M. Lafarge</span>  :      Je vous recontacterai quand nous prendrons une d\u00e9cision finale. Merci d'\u00eatre venu.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span>  :      De rien."}], "audiosrc": "frn2le08ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le08ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler des diff\u00e9rentes personnalit\u00e9s des gens.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux dire comment vont les gens.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de travail.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Aimez-vous passer des entretiens ?  Pourquoi ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Comment vous sentez-vous lors des entretiens ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "C'est le grand jour pour Pierre ! L'heure de son entretien avec M. Lafarge est arriv\u00e9e. Est-il nerveux ? Est-il est pr\u00eat ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Pierre est \u00e0 son <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">entretien</span>. Qu'est-ce qui se passe  ? ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"